    <bpmn:process id="W_W4466" name="W4466. Random Drug Testing — Selection, Notice &amp; Execution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Random-testing cycle (DOLE D.O. 53-03 requires random testing)
Frequency: Per cycle (e.g. periodic; safety-sensitive higher rate)
Volume: Random sample of workforce incl. all safety-sensitive roles (W4459)
Owner: Occupational Health (VS-83) / HR (VS-103) / HSE (VS-24)
Participants: Occupational Health (VS-83), HR (VS-103), HSE (VS-24), Vendor (W4460), Security (VS-23), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4466 — Random Drug Testing — Selection, Notice &amp; Execution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4466_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4466_Lane1" name="Occupational Health">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4466_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4466_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4466_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4466_Lane2" name="Vendor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4466_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4466_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4466_Start4" name="Random-testing cycle (DOLE D.O. 53-03 requires random testing)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4466_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4466_Task5" name="random">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Occupational Health/HR run a documented random selection (computer-generated, unbiased) covering the required proportion of the workforce (higher for safety-sensitive W4459), per D.O. 53-03
Responsible (R): Occupational Health / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO / Compliance Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4466_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4466_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4466_Task6" name="Occupational Health/HR/Security notify selected employees (unannounced…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Occupational Health/HR/Security notify selected employees (unannounced, same-day where feasible to prevent evasion), arrange collection with vendor, and manage the process confidentially
Responsible (R): Occupational Health / HR / Security / Vendor
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4466_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4466_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4466_Task7" name="Vendor collect/test (W4469/W4470), Occupational Health/HR act on results…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Vendor collect/test (W4469/W4470), Occupational Health/HR act on results (negative → resume; positive → W4471), and document the cycle for DOLE (W4477)
Responsible (R): Vendor / Occupational Health / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4466_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4466_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4466_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4466_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-681 (ensure controlled execution — Drug Testing Operations, Results &amp; Case Management (PA-150.2).) | - CTL-681: documented unbiased random selection; safety-sensitive proportion met; unannounced notification; chain-of-custody; documented for DOLE (W4477)
Owner: Occupational Health (VS-83) / HR (VS-103) / HSE (VS-24)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4466_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4466_Annotation9" targetRef="W4466_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4466_Flow11" sourceRef="W4466_Start4" targetRef="W4466_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4466_Flow12" sourceRef="W4466_Task5" targetRef="W4466_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4466_Flow13" sourceRef="W4466_Task6" targetRef="W4466_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4466_Flow14" sourceRef="W4466_Task7" targetRef="W4466_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
