      <bpmn:userTask id="W4469_Task5" name="chain-of-custody">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Vendor collect the specimen per DOH/D.O. 53-03 procedure — identity verification, observed/split-specimen protocol, tamper-evidence, and the chain-of-custody form signed at every transfer
Responsible (R): Vendor / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): Occupational Health Lead
Duration: Per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4469_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4469_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4469_Task6" name="Vendor transport to the DOH-accredited lab, perform the initial screen +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vendor transport to the DOH-accredited lab, perform the initial screen + confirmatory test (GC-MS or equivalent) on positives, and maintain chain-of-custody/evidence integrity
Responsible (R): Vendor / Lab
Accountable (A): Occupational Health Lead
Duration: Per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4469_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4469_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4469_Task7" name="Occupational Health/Vendor return the result + chain-of-custody record to MRO…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Occupational Health/Vendor return the result + chain-of-custody record to MRO (W4470) and HR (confidentially, W4462), and retain per records policy (VS-88)
Responsible (R): Occupational Health / Vendor
Accountable (A): Occupational Health Lead
Duration: Per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4469_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
