    <bpmn:process id="W_W4472" name="W4472. Disciplinary, Separation &amp; Legal (NLRC) Handling of Positive Cases" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Outcome decision (W4471) for severe/safety-sensitive/recurrent/refusal cases
Frequency: Per case
Volume: Disciplinary/separation cases (subset of positives)
Owner: Labor Relations (VS-84) / HR (VS-103) / Legal (VS-100)
Participants: Labor Relations (VS-84), HR (VS-103), Legal (VS-100), CHRO, Security (VS-23), Occupational Health (VS-83)
Source: workflow W4472 — Disciplinary, Separation &amp; Legal (NLRC) Handling of Positive Cases</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4472_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4472_Lane1" name="Labor Relations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4472_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4472_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4472_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4472_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4472_Lane3" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4472_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4472_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4472_Start5" name="Outcome decision (W4471) for severe/safety-sensitive/recurrent/refusal cases">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4472_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4472_Task6" name="Labor Relations/HR execute disciplinary/suspension or separation per policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Labor Relations/HR execute disciplinary/suspension or separation per policy (W4457), the CBA (VS-84), and the Labor Code (due process: notice → hearing → decision), with full documentation
Responsible (R): Labor Relations / HR / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4472_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4472_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4472_Task7" name="Legal/Labor Relations manage any NLRC/DOLE challenge (illegal dismissal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Labor Relations manage any NLRC/DOLE challenge (illegal dismissal, due-process challenge), prepare defense, and represent BuildRight (VS-100)
Responsible (R): Legal / Labor Relations
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per challenge</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4472_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4472_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4472_Task8" name="HR/Security manage access/exit, final pay (VS-19.2), and any reference/records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Security manage access/exit, final pay (VS-19.2), and any reference/records (VS-88) with confidentiality (W4462); Occupational Health/HR coordinate rehabilitation alternative where applicable (W4473)
Responsible (R): HR / Security / Legal / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4472_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4472_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4472_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4472_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-681 (ensure controlled execution — Drug Testing Operations, Results &amp; Case Management (PA-150.2).) | - CTL-681: discipline/separation per policy/CBA/Labor Code due process; documented; NLRC-defense ready; access/exit/final-pay managed; confidentiality maintained
Owner: Labor Relations (VS-84) / HR (VS-103) / Legal (VS-100)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
